  "description": "Subject: Using a VA home loan? Let’s compare the details | Preheader: Review VA pricing, eligibility, and costs for your plans.",
  "type": "email",
  "builder": "mailpurse",
  "html_content": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Using a VA home loan? Let’s compare the details</title></head><body style=\"margin:0;background:#f1f4f8;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all\">Review VA pricing, eligibility, and costs for your plans.</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#f1f4f8\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#fff\"><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 30px;border-top:5px solid #0BFF56\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/\"><img src=\"https://app.gorealo.org/email-template-previews/gorealo/gorealo-logo.png\" width=\"154\" alt=\"GoRealo\" style=\"display:block;width:154px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0\"></a><p style=\"margin:9px 0 0;color:#667085;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.5px\">MORTGAGE OPTIONS, MADE CLEAR</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:30px;background:#f0f5ff\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#003FDA;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px\">FOR THOSE WHO SERVED</p><h1 style=\"font-size:30px;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 16px;color:#162849\">Explore the VA option with a clear view of costs.</h1><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#374151;margin:0 0 14px\">Hi {{first_name}}, if you’re eligible for VA financing, comparing the full offer can help you understand how it fits your purchase or refinance.</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#162849;font-weight:bold;margin:0\">Are you looking to buy or refinance with a VA loan?</p><p style=\"margin:20px 0 0\"><img src=\"https://app.gorealo.org/email-template-previews/gorealo/assets/move-deals-forward.png\" alt=\"GoRealo: VA buyers\" width=\"540\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:540px;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:8px\"></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:22px 30px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\"><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;color:#162849\">Compare more than the rate</h2><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#4b5563;margin:0\">Review APR, points, fees, funding fee treatment, term, and estimated payment.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\"><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;color:#162849\">Confirm your situation</h2><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#4b5563;margin:0\">Eligibility and loan terms depend on VA requirements and your individual circumstances.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\"><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;color:#162849\">Use current pricing</h2><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#4b5563;margin:0\">Published rates are examples for stated assumptions and may change without notice.</p></td></tr></table><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#374151;margin:22px 0\">Reply with your goal and approximate timeline. We can help you locate current VA options and questions to ask.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#374151\">Warmly,<br><strong>The GoRealo Team</strong></p><table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin:22px 0\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#003FDA\" style=\"border-radius:4px\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/mortgage-rates/\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold\">View current VA rates</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085\">Prefer to talk? Call <a href=\"tel:+18667139292\" style=\"color:#003FDA\">1-866-713-9292</a> or reply to this email.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:20px 30px;background:#f4f6f9\"><p style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085;margin:0\">GoRealo® is a DBA of Consumer Credit Services, LLC. NMLS #1070755 · Florida Mortgage Broker License #MBR1434.<br>5011 Gate Parkway Bldg 100, Suite 100, Jacksonville, FL 32256.<br>Equal Housing Opportunity. Credit, collateral, eligibility, and program terms apply.</p><p style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/privacy-policy/\" style=\"color:#003FDA\">Privacy</a> · <a href=\"{{unsubscribe_url}}\" style=\"color:#003FDA\">Unsubscribe</a></p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
  "plain_text_content": "Using a VA home loan? Let’s compare the details Review VA pricing, eligibility, and costs for your plans. MORTGAGE OPTIONS, MADE CLEAR FOR THOSE WHO SERVED Explore the VA option with a clear view of costs. Hi {{first_name}}, if you’re eligible for VA financing, comparing the full offer can help you understand how it fits your purchase or refinance. Are you looking to buy or refinance with a VA loan? Compare more than the rate Review APR, points, fees, funding fee treatment, term, and estimated payment. Confirm your situation Eligibility and loan terms depend on VA requirements and your individual circumstances. Use current pricing Published rates are examples for stated assumptions and may change without notice. Reply with your goal and approximate timeline. We can help you locate current VA options and questions to ask. Warmly, The GoRealo Team View current VA rates Prefer to talk? Call 1-866-713-9292 or reply to this email. GoRealo® is a DBA of Consumer Credit Services, LLC. NMLS #1070755 · Florida Mortgage Broker License #MBR1434. 5011 Gate Parkway Bldg 100, Suite 100, Jacksonville, FL 32256. Equal Housing Opportunity. Credit, collateral, eligibility, and program terms apply. Privacy · Unsubscribe",
